<!--
    Android TV / Google TV launcher banner (320 x 180 dp). It mirrors
    branding/feature-graphic.svg so the TV home row and the Play listing share one look.

    - Background: DESIGN.md `gradient-hero` (#005BC1 -> #6446CD, 135 deg).
    - Cube + viewport brackets: the SceneView logo, face colours of branding/feature-graphic.svg,
      true isometric faces so no side face pokes past the top one.
    - Wordmark: Inter (DESIGN.md `font-body`) ExtraBold, converted to outlines because a
      VectorDrawable cannot draw text. Subtitle: Inter SemiBold at 85 % white.
    Full-bleed and opaque, as the TV launcher expects; no text within 16 dp of an edge.
-->
